{"id":"n84526-1-7","stage":5,"title":"학창 · 校园","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84526-1-7-1","ko":"학창 시절이 그립네.","zh":"真想念学生时代啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"학창","meaning":"校园，寒窗","explanation":"학창：校园，寒窗","readings":[{"term":"학창","audio":"/audio/20b8a7904ea8e9504c52.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84526","senseId":"1","lemma":"학창","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시절이","meaning":"时代，岁月","explanation":"시절：时代，岁月；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시절","audio":"/audio/4ccb6cf5cb86b6f8cebe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65302","senseId":"4","lemma":"시절","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그립네.","meaning":"思念，怀念","explanation":"그립다：思念，怀念；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"그립다","audio":"/audio/b0dcbd20216264fb84be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37070","senseId":"1","lemma":"그립다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"20b8a7904ea8e950","term":"학창","zh":"校园，寒窗","audio":"/audio/20b8a7904ea8e9504c52.mp3","entryId":"84526","definition":"学习的教室或学校。","pronunciation":["학창"]},{"id":"4ccb6cf5cb86b6f8","term":"시절","zh":"时代，岁月","audio":"/audio/4ccb6cf5cb86b6f8cebe.mp3","entryId":"65302","definition":"时代的状况。","pronunciation":["시절"]},{"id":"b0dcbd20216264fb","term":"그립다","zh":"思念，怀念","audio":"/audio/b0dcbd20216264fb84be.mp3","entryId":"37070","definition":"非常想念，想见面。","pronunciation":["그립따"]}],"audio":"/audio/8468e9229a76461d2f12.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n84526-1-7-2","ko":"그러게. 우리 학교 다닐 때 매일 붙어 다니고 참 즐거웠었는데.","zh":"是啊。我们在学校读书的时候整天形影不离，那段时光真是快乐极了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게.","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entr